  <h2>Where to go from here</h2>
  <p>If you are early in your pipeline build, the highest-leverage move is to write down your source policy and your provenance schema before you fetch anything. If you are mid-build and the fetcher is the part eating your engineering hours, the highest-leverage move is to decide whether you want to keep owning that complexity.</p>

